{
  "dn2:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 2 ",
  "dn2:0.2": "Sāmaññaphalasutta ",
  "dn2:1.0": "1. Rājāmaccakathā ",
  "dn2:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn2:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati jīvakassa komārabhaccassa ambavane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ aḍḍhateḷasehi bhikkhusatehi. ",
  "dn2:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena rājā māgadho ajātasattu vedehiputto tadahuposathe pannarase komudiyā cātumāsiniyā puṇṇāya puṇṇamāya rattiyā rājāmaccaparivuto uparipāsādavaragato nisinno hoti. ",
  "dn2:1.4": "Atha kho rājā māgadho ajātasattu vedehiputto tadahuposathe udānaṁ udānesi: ",
  "dn2:1.5": "“ramaṇīyā vata bho dosinā ratti, abhirūpā vata bho dosinā ratti, dassanīyā vata bho dosinā ratti, pāsādikā vata bho dosinā ratti, lakkhaññā vata bho dosinā ratti. ",
  "dn2:1.6": "Kaṁ nu khvajja samaṇaṁ vā brāhmaṇaṁ vā payirupāseyyāma, yaṁ no payirupāsato cittaṁ pasīdeyyā”ti? ",
  "dn2:2.1": "Evaṁ vutte, aññataro rājāmacco rājānaṁ māgadhaṁ ajātasattuṁ vedehiputtaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "dn2:2.2": "“ayaṁ, deva, pūraṇo kassapo saṅghī ceva gaṇī ca gaṇācariyo ca ñāto yasassī titthakaro sādhusammato bahujanassa rattaññū cirapabbajito addhagato vayoanuppatto. ",
  "dn2:2.3": "Taṁ devo pūraṇaṁ kassapaṁ payirupāsatu. ",
  "dn2:2.4": "Appeva nāma devassa pūraṇaṁ kassapaṁ payirupāsato cittaṁ pasīdeyyā”ti. ",
  "dn2:2.5": "Evaṁ vutte, rājā māgadho ajātasattu vedehiputto